'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a [[Boosters|Booster]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''. When equipped, a Helldiver squad gets 2 free uses of the [[EAT-17 Expendable Anti-Tank]] support weapon per mission.

== Description ==
Provides two free uses of the EAT-17 Expendable Anti-Tank support weapon per mission; a total of 4 launchers, one for each Helldiver.

== Procurement ==
The {{PAGENAME}} Booster is unlocked on the 2nd page of the [[Ironclad Democracy Premium Warbond]] for {{Currency|Medals|55}}.

== Tactical Information ==
* As long as as one squad member has the booster equipped, any Helldiver may call down a pod filled with two EAT-17 launchers.
* The launchers can be called down as usual from the stratagem menu.
** The stratagem itself has two charges, and cannot be rearmed.

